        },
        {
          "id": "31-hordequest-lesson-2",
          "order": 2,
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "speakerName": "主角",
          "indigenousText": "Kukui kɨkɨ.",
          "chineseText": "我叫Kukui。",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/62796/874238.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/lesson/boy.png",
          "background": "1-2.jpg"
        },
        {
          "id": "31-hordequest-lesson-3",
          "order": 3,
          "speaker": "classmate",
          "speakerName": "同學",
          "indigenousText": "ika tékadra ku dasu? /dasu ka ika tékadra?",
          "chineseText": "你的家在哪裡？",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/62796/874239.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/lesson/girl.png",
          "background": "1-1.jpg"
        },
        {
          "id": "31-hordequest-lesson-4",
          "order": 4,
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "speakerName": "主角",
          "indigenousText": "salké kɨkɨ teldrɨka ckɨckɨlɨ mukné.",
          "chineseText": "我從茂林部落來。",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/62796/874240.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/lesson/boy.png",
          "background": "1-2.jpg"
        },
        {
          "id": "31-hordequest-lesson-5",
          "order": 5,
          "speaker": "classmate",
          "speakerName": "同學",
          "indigenousText": "tikierɨnga musu?",
          "chineseText": "你吃早餐了嗎？",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/62796/874241.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/lesson/girl.png",
          "background": "1-1.jpg"
        },
        {
          "id": "31-hordequest-lesson-6",
          "order": 6,
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "speakerName": "主角",
          "indigenousText": "énila!",
          "chineseText": "還沒耶！",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/62796/874242.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/lesson/boy.png",
          "background": "1-2.jpg"
        },
        {
          "id": "31-hordequest-lesson-7",
          "order": 7,
          "speaker": "classmate",
          "speakerName": "同學",
          "indigenousText": "nwama kɨkɨ longé na kierɨ, nunguresɨ ma musu mua?",
          "chineseText": "我要去買早餐，你要一起去嗎？",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/62796/874243.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/lesson/girl.png",
          "background": "1-1.jpg"
        },
        {
          "id": "31-hordequest-lesson-8",
          "order": 8,
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "speakerName": "主角",
          "indigenousText": "imɨcɨ kɨkɨ na pésu, nuduru ma musu késdamɨ la kwa na pésu?",
          "chineseText": "我沒有帶錢，你可以借我錢嗎？",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/62796/874244.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/lesson/boy.png",
          "background": "1-2.jpg"
        },
        {
          "id": "31-hordequest-lesson-9",
          "order": 9,
          "speaker": "classmate",
          "speakerName": "同學",
          "indigenousText": "iyo, ku ksédmɨ swa.",
          "chineseText": "好，我借你。",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/62796/874245.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/lesson/girl.png",
          "background": "1-1.jpg"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "find",
      "name": "尋找物品",
      "intro": "今天家裡要辦婚禮，很多親戚都來了。看到大家忙得不可開交，主角決定要幫大家一起準備。",
      "characters": [
        {
          "id": "classmate",
          "name": "同學",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/find/girl.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "mother",
          "name": "媽媽",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/find/mom.png"
        }
      ],
      "turns": [
        {
          "id": "31-hordequest-find-1",
          "order": 1,
          "speaker": "classmate",
          "speakerName": "同學",
          "indigenousText": "navé, madro papréta mukani data sesa yo!",
          "chineseText": "媽媽，今天家裡來了好多親戚哦！",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/66263/924563.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/find/girl.png",
          "background": "1-1.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "31-hordequest-find-2",
          "order": 2,
          "speaker": "mother",
          "speakerName": "媽媽",
          "indigenousText": "saplangɨne kakasovlé sesa, sukéni mukné madro na ico.",
          "chineseText": "今天是哥哥的婚禮，所以有很多人來。",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/66263/924564.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/find/mom.png",
          "background": "1-2.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "31-hordequest-find-3",
          "order": 3,
          "speaker": "classmate",
          "speakerName": "同學",
          "indigenousText": "mabebere madɨ! médavli ku icɨnglanɨme nianga!",
          "chineseText": "好開心喔！很久沒有看到他們了！",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/66263/924565.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/find/girl.png",
          "background": "1-1.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "31-hordequest-find-4",
          "order": 4,
          "speaker": "mother",
          "speakerName": "媽媽",
          "indigenousText": "iyo vi! makasi, kirikucu ma miti samia sesa, nupusopra ma musu.",
          "chineseText": "對啊！但是，今天大家都會很忙，你要幫忙大家。",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/66263/924566.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/find/mom.png",
          "background": "1-2.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "31-hordequest-find-5",
          "order": 5,
          "speaker": "classmate",
          "speakerName": "同學",
          "indigenousText": "iyo, nupusopra mianga kɨkɨ.",
          "chineseText": "好的，我一定會幫忙！",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/66263/924567.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/find/girl.png",
          "background": "1-1.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "31-hordequest-find-6",
          "order": 6,
          "speaker": "mother",
          "speakerName": "媽媽",
          "indigenousText": "kwala ptarme kuyenɨnga nusarkata na makainunga!",
          "chineseText": "我要去準備等一下要用的東西了。",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/66263/924568.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/find/mom.png",
          "background": "1-2.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "31-hordequest-find-7",
          "order": 7,
          "speaker": "classmate",
          "speakerName": "同學",
          "indigenousText": "kukné pusopra!",
          "chineseText": "我來幫忙！",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/66263/924569.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/find/girl.png",
          "background": "1-1.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "31-hordequest-find-8",
          "order": 8,
          "speaker": "mother",
          "speakerName": "媽媽",
          "indigenousText": "iyo, nanga tkapra kwa!",
          "chineseText": "好，來跟隨我！",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/66263/924570.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/find/mom.png",
          "background": "1-2.png"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "outside",
      "name": "戶外活動",
      "intro": "今天是星期六。主角正在和哥哥聊天，討論明天的行程。來看看他們要去哪裡玩吧！",
      "characters": [
        {
          "id": "protagonist",
          "name": "主角",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/outside/boy-1.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "sibling",
          "name": "哥哥",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/outside/boy-2.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "mother",
          "name": "媽媽",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/outside/mom.png"
        }
      ],
      "turns": [
        {
          "id": "31-hordequest-outside-1",
          "order": 1,
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "speakerName": "主角",
          "indigenousText": "Bakɨ, niciobi na kusianga, iké kuwa yasu?",
          "chineseText": "Bakɨ，明天是星期天，你打算去哪裡？",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/65814/919649.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/outside/boy-1.png",
          "background": "1-1.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "31-hordequest-outside-2",
          "order": 2,
          "speaker": "sibling",
          "speakerName": "哥哥",
          "indigenousText": "nunguresɨ ma knamɨ Aruy na kusianga mua drɨkerle tibila okɨme butulu, musu ka?",
          "chineseText": "我明天要和Aruy去溪邊烤肉，你呢？",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/65814/919650.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/outside/boy-2.png",
          "background": "1-2.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "31-hordequest-outside-3",
          "order": 3,
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "speakerName": "主角",
          "indigenousText": "biciringi madɨ ka amina margi tamililivanɨ! nuduru ma kɨkɨ nguresɨ mua?",
          "chineseText": "聽起來很好玩！我也可以一起去嗎？",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/65814/919651.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/outside/boy-1.png",
          "background": "1-1.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "31-hordequest-outside-4",
          "order": 4,
          "speaker": "sibling",
          "speakerName": "哥哥",
          "indigenousText": "thiurala kububuru ninana!",
          "chineseText": "你先問媽媽！（註︰魯凱族稱謂長輩的規範︰都是大家的爺爺、奶奶、爸爸、媽媽稱呼著；因此部落的長輩多或少了，所以部落的長輩都是很重要的人物。）",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/65814/919652.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/outside/boy-2.png",
          "background": "1-2.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "31-hordequest-outside-5",
          "order": 5,
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "speakerName": "主角",
          "indigenousText": "navé, nuduruma kɨkɨ nguresɨ kakana sovlé mua drɨkerle tibila?",
          "chineseText": "媽媽，我可以跟哥哥一起去溪邊嗎？",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/65814/919653.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/outside/boy-1.png",
          "background": "1-1.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "31-hordequest-outside-6",
          "order": 6,
          "speaker": "mother",
          "speakerName": "媽媽",
          "indigenousText": "nakuni, makasi mungukocuvana!",
          "chineseText": "可以，但你們要小心喔！",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/65814/919654.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/outside/mom.png",
          "background": "1-3.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "31-hordequest-outside-7",
          "order": 7,
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "speakerName": "主角",
          "indigenousText": "iyo, nusauringo ma knamɨ!",
          "chineseText": "沒問題，我們一定會注意的！",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/65814/919655.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/outside/boy-1.png",
